Subject: [PATCH] accel/rocket: default to the validated 600 MHz OPP

Use the product operating point on RK3588 without a manual module parameter.
The existing probe checks still require the matching DT OPP and voltage.

--- a/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/accel/rocket/rocket_drv.c
@@ -26,8 +26,8 @@
 static struct platform_device *drm_dev;
 static struct rocket_device *rdev;
 
-/* Opt-in shared voltage/frequency policy; zero preserves the DT state. */
-unsigned long rocket_active_hz;
+/* Default to the validated RK3588 operating point; zero keeps DT state. */
+unsigned long rocket_active_hz = 600000000;
 module_param_named(active_hz, rocket_active_hz, ulong, 0444);
 MODULE_PARM_DESC(active_hz, "0 for DT state, 600000000 Hz / 800 mV, or 800000000 Hz / 850 mV");
 
